class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;4. Schedule Updates&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="4-schedule-updates"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#4-schedule-updates" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform OTA during low-activity periods&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Avoid updates during critical pool operation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consider scheduled maintenance windows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Recovery Procedures&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="recovery-procedures"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#recovery-procedures" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3&gt;OTA Update Failure Recovery&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="ota-update-failure-recovery"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#ota-update-failure-recovery" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;If OTA update fails and device becomes unresponsive:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Physical Access Recovery&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connect via USB serial&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Upload firmware via serial: &lt;code&gt;pio run -e esp32dev --target upload&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bootloader Recovery&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ESP32 bootloader allows serial recovery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold BOOT button during power-on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Upload firmware via esptool&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Factory Reset&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In WebUI: System tab → &lt;strong&gt;Factory Reset&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Or serial command: clear NVS + LittleFS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
