&lt;li&gt;&lt;input checked="" disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; Web-based OTA update interface (System tab)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input checked="" disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; Automatic update checking from GitHub releases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; Rollback capability to previous firmware&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; A/B partition updates for safer updates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; Update scheduling via MQTT commands&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
